  "body_text": "LDgenX\n            Uncover biodiversity through DNA\nAbout us\n        LDgenX supports public and private organizations in their biodiversity monitoring, species conservation, sustainable agriculture and aquaculture projects through cutting-edge genomics.\n From sample collection to data interpretation, our team, with more than 10 years of experience, transforms genetic information into actionable decision-support tools.\n \n    \n                        Ask a quote       \n            Schedule a Meeting\n            Services\n        Environmental DNA (eDNA)Detection and monitoring of species through the analysis of DNA traces present in the environment.Population genomicsAssessment of genetic diversity, population connectivity, and local adaptation.Microbial Community AnalysisCharacterization of bacterial, fungal, and microbial communities using high-throughput sequencing technologies.Genomic SelectionDevelopment of genetic tools to support breeding and selection programs.BioinformaticsAnalysis, processing, and interpretation of genomic data.Sequencing & dPCRAmplicon sequencing, short- and long-read sequencing, and development and analysis of digital PCR (dPCR) assays\n            Our Areas of Expertise\n        \n            Why Choose LDgenX?\n        ✓ Recognized scientific expertise✓ End-to-end project support✓ Tailor-made solutions✓ Cutting-edge technologies✓ A French DeepTech company\n            Recognized and Supported Innovation\n        LDgenX is a DeepTech company specializing in genomics applied to biodiversity, agriculture, and aquaculture.\n Our research and development activities are supported by leading innovation and research organizations, including CREALIA, BPI France, Accademic Parteners. \n            DNA Ecotrace\n        \n        Our innovative environmental DNA biodiversity monitoring project combines : ✓ non-invasive sampling✓ long-read sequencing✓ artificial intelligence✓ simplified presentation of results\n            They trust us\n        123456789101112131415161718192021222324\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
